@BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136

GET {{BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@platformAdminToken = REPLACE_WITH_PLATFORM_ADMIN_TOKEN
@tenantId = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_TENANT_ID

### Actualizar aplicaciones de una empresa (PlatformAdmin)
PUT {{BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/companies/{{tenantId}}/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modules": ["Bazares", "Catalogs"]
}

### Empresa inexistente: 404
PUT {{BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/companies/nonexistent-tenant/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modules": ["Catalogs"]
}

### Venta de contado (SuperAdmin). Reutilizar la misma clave solo para reintentar la misma venta.
@paymentsToken = REPLACE_WITH_SUPERADMIN_TOKEN
POST {{BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress}}/payment/PaySales
Authorization: Bearer {{paymentsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 0,
  "sellerId": 1,
  "totalAmount": 1200,
  "costPrice": 800,
  "commissionAmount": 100,
  "productDescription": "Venta de contado al publico",
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "isCashSale": true,
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "idempotencyKey": "cash-manual-test-001"
}

### Venta de contado sin comisionista: 400
POST {{BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress}}/payment/PaySales
Authorization: Bearer {{paymentsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 0,
  "totalAmount": 1200,
  "costPrice": 800,
  "commissionAmount": 100,
  "productDescription": "Prueba de validacion",
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "isCashSale": true,
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "idempotencyKey": "cash-invalid-test-001"
}

### Excel de todas las deudas activas (SuperAdmin)
GET {{BusinessCloud.Api_HostAddress}}/payment/PaySales/debts/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{paymentsToken}}
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
